# Phase 9: browser-assist runtime scratch space (app.applications.browser_assist)
# -- never persists cookies/sessions itself (every browser context is
# ephemeral, closed at the end of every call), but this directory must still
# never be committed in case any temp/download artifact ever lands here.
data/browser_assist_runtime/

